  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1)/(25)∶ (1)/(x) = (1)/(x)∶(1)/(625)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nIn a proportion (a)/(b) = (c)/(d) , then a × d = b × c\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nGiven: (1)/(25)∶ (1)/(x) = (1)/(x)∶(1)/(625)\n\nConvert the proportion to an equation:\n\n(1)/(25) × (1)/(625) = (1)/(x) × (1)/(x)\n\n⇒ (1)/(25 × 625) = (1)/(x²)\n\n⇒ (1)/(25² × 25) = (1)/(x²)\n\n⇒ (1)/(25³) = (1)/(x²)\n\n⇒ x² = 25³\n\n⇒ x = sqrt{25³}\n\n⇒ x = 25¹.⁵\n\n⇒ x = 25 × 5\n\n⇒ x = 125\n\n**The value of x is 125.**\n\n1ee:T6b5,",
